  "prefLabel": "Ed 1016.08 Transition of an Individual to Extended Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1016.08 Transition of an Individual to Extended Services. The NHVR shall provide for the transition of an individual with the most significant disabilities to extended services no later than 18 months after placement in supported employment, unless a longer period is established in the IPE, and only if the individual has made substantial progress toward meeting the hours-per-week work goal identified in the IPE, the individual is stabilized in the job, and extended services are available and can be provided without a hiatus in services.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1000.html"
}
